        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Because <strong>zero server uploads</strong> occur, your confidential files—including unpublished research manuscripts, software API keys, proprietary database SQL dumps, and legal contracts—remain strictly on your computer. You can disconnect your internet connection entirely after loading this page, and all text formatting functions will continue running at peak speed.
